      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Liding%C3%B6",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Millesgården sculpture museum on Lidingö showcases works by sculptor Carl Milles and is a cultural landmark.",
